        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 111: The array B=[1,2,2,2]B = [1, 2, 2, 2]B=[1,2,2,2]. We can convert the array AAA to array BBB using 333 operations in the following way:\n\nOperation 111: Choose i=4i = 4i=4 and S={1,2,3,4}S = \\{1, 2, 3, 4\\}S={1,2,3,4}. Thus, we set A4=A1⊕A2⊕A3⊕A4=2⊕2⊕1⊕2=3A_4 = A_1\\oplus A_2\\oplus A_3\\oplus A_4 = 2\\oplus 2\\oplus 1\\oplus 2 = 3A4​=A1​⊕A2​⊕A3​⊕A4​=2⊕2⊕1⊕2=3. Thus, the array becomes [2,2,2,3][2, 2, 2, 3][2,2,2,3].\nOperation 222: Choose i=1i = 1i=1 and S={1,4}S = \\{1, 4\\}S={1,4}. Thus, we set A1=A1⊕A4=2⊕3=1A_1 = A_1\\oplus A_4 = 2\\oplus 3 = 1A1​=A1​⊕A4​=2⊕3=1. Thus, the array becomes [1,2,2,3][1, 2, 2, 3][1,2,2,3].\nOperation 333: Choose i=4i = 4i=4 and S={1,4}S = \\{1, 4\\}S={1,4}. Thus, we set A4=A1⊕A4=1⊕3=2A_4 = A_1\\oplus A_4 = 1\\oplus 3 = 2A4​=A1​⊕A4​=1⊕3=2. Thus, the array becomes [1,2,2,2][1, 2, 2, 2][1,2,2,2].\n\nNote that there might be other ways to convert the array as well.\nTest case 222: The array B=[1,3,4,5,5]B = [1, 3, 4, 5, 5]B=[1,3,4,5,5]. We can convert the array AAA to array BBB using 222 operations in the following way:\n\nOperation 111: Choose i=4i = 4i=4 and S={1,4}S = \\{1, 4\\}S={1,4}. Thus, we set A4=A1⊕A4=1⊕4=5A_4 = A_1\\oplus A_4 = 1\\oplus 4 = 5A4​=A1​⊕A4​=1⊕4=5. Thus, the array becomes [1,3,5,5,5][1, 3, 5, 5, 5][1,3,5,5,5].\nOperation 222: Choose i=3i = 3i=3 and S={1,3,4,5}S = \\{1, 3, 4, 5\\}S={1,3,4,5}. Thus, we set A3=A1⊕A3⊕A4⊕A5=1⊕5⊕5⊕5=4A_3 = A_1\\oplus A_3\\oplus A_4\\oplus A_5 = 1\\oplus 5\\oplus 5\\oplus 5 = 4A3​=A1​⊕A3​⊕A4​⊕A5​=1⊕5⊕5⊕5=4. Thus, the array becomes [1,3,4,5,5][1, 3, 4, 5, 5][1,3,4,5,5].\n\nNote that there might be other ways to convert the array as well.\nTest case 333: The array B=[2,4,5,5,6,6]B = [2, 4, 5, 5, 6, 6]B=[2,4,5,5,6,6]. Since the array is already equal to array BBB, we require 000 operations."
